#. Translators: Name of the add-on in the NVDA Tools menu.
msgid "&Native Speech Generation"
msgstr "&Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Tooltip or description for the Native Speech Generation Tools menu item.
msgid "Generate speech using Gemini TTS"
msgstr "Hasilkan ucapan menggunakan Gemini TTS"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for opening the Native Speech Generation dialog.
msgid "Open the Native Speech Generation dialog"
msgstr "Buka dialog Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Input gestures category name for Native Speech Generation.
#. Translators: Title of the settings panel in NVDA preferences.
#. Translators: Summary for this add-on shown in NVDA's Add-ons Store and Add-ons Manager.
msgid "Native Speech Generation"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for speaking the selected text with Quick Speak.
msgid "Speak selected text with Quick Speak, or stop Quick Speak"
msgstr "Bacakan teks terpilih dengan Quick Speak, atau hentikan Quick Speak"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for speaking clipboard text with Quick Speak.
msgid "Speak clipboard text with Quick Speak, or stop Quick Speak"
msgstr "Bacakan teks clipboard dengan Quick Speak, atau hentikan Quick Speak"

#. Translators: Error announced when Quick Speak is invoked in a restricted NVDA mode.
msgid "Quick Speak is unavailable in this NVDA mode."
msgstr "Quick Speak tidak tersedia dalam mode NVDA ini."

#. Translators: Warning shown when the user tries to open the add-on dialog twice.
msgid ""
"The Native Speech Generation add-on is already open. Please close the dialog "
"before opening it again."
msgstr ""
"Add-on Native Speech Generation sudah terbuka. Harap tutup dialog sebelum "
"membukanya lagi."

#. Translators: Title of warning dialog when the user tries to open the add-on twice.
msgid "Add-on Already Running"
msgstr "Add-on sudah berjalan"

#. Translators: Error shown when the main add-on dialog cannot be opened.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to open Native Speech Generation dialog: {error}"
msgstr "Gagal membuka dialog Native Speech Generation: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of a dependency installation error dialog.
#. Translators: Title of an error dialog in Talk With AI.
#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI enters an error state.
#. Translators: Title of an API key configuration error dialog.
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Kesalahan"

#. Translators: Message shown when dependency installation is still pending.
msgid ""
"Native Speech Generation is installing dependencies. Please restart NVDA for "
"the changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Native Speech Generation sedang memasang dependensi. Silakan mulai ulang "
"NVDA agar perubahan diterapkan."

#. Translators: Title of the information dialog recommending an NVDA restart.
msgid "Restart Required"
msgstr "Perlu Mulai Ulang"

#. Translators: Error shown when this add-on has no trusted checksum for a dependency archive.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "No approved checksum is bundled for {assetName}."
msgstr "Tidak ada checksum yang disetujui yang disertakan untuk {assetName}."

msgid ""
"PyAudio checksum metadata does not match the checksum approved by this add-"
"on."
msgstr ""
"Metadata checksum PyAudio tidak cocok dengan checksum yang disetujui oleh "
"add-on ini."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Failed to download or install required libraries. The add-on might not work "
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"Error: {error}"
msgstr ""
"Gagal mengunduh atau menginstal library yang diperlukan. Add-on mungkin "
"tidak berfungsi dengan benar.\n"
"\n"
"Kesalahan: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of a progress dialog shown while installing add-on dependencies.
msgid "Installing Dependencies"
msgstr "Menginstal dependensi"

#. Translators: Initial progress message while dependency installation is being prepared.
msgid "Checking for required libraries..."
msgstr "Memeriksa library yang diperlukan..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown when dependency installation has completed.
msgid "Installation complete!"
msgstr "Instalasi selesai!"

#. Translators: Message shown after dependencies are installed and NVDA must restart.
msgid ""
"The Native Speech Generation libraries have been successfully installed/"
"updated.\n"
"\n"
"Please restart NVDA for the changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Library Native Speech Generation telah berhasil dipasang/diperbarui.\n"
"\n"
"Silakan mulai ulang NVDA agar perubahan diterapkan."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog shown after dependency installation completes.
msgid "Installation Complete"
msgstr "Instalasi Selesai"

#. Translators: Error shown when dependency installation fails.
msgid "Library installation failed. Please check the log."
msgstr "Instalasi library gagal. Silakan periksa log."

#. Translators: Confirmation before reinstalling or updating external Python dependencies from GitHub.
msgid ""
"This will reinstall the verified PyAudio wheel for NVDA's Python runtime and "
"require an NVDA restart. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Tindakan ini akan memasang ulang wheel PyAudio terverifikasi untuk runtime "
"Python NVDA dan memerlukan restart NVDA. Lanjutkan?"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog confirming a dependency library reinstall.
msgid "Confirm Library Update"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Pembaruan Library"

#. Translators: Confirmation shown when required libraries are missing.
msgid ""
"PyAudio is missing or incompatible. Click OK to download the verified wheel "
"for NVDA's Python runtime."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio tidak tersedia atau tidak kompatibel. Klik OK untuk mengunduh wheel "
"terverifikasi bagi runtime Python NVDA."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog shown when dependency libraries are missing.
msgid "Missing Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependensi tidak ditemukan"

#. Translators: Progress message shown while verified libraries are being extracted.
msgid "Extracting libraries..."
msgstr "Mengekstraksi library..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while replacing the dependency library folder.
msgid "Installing libraries..."
msgstr "Menginstal library..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown after library extraction and installation.
msgid "Library installation complete."
msgstr "Pemasangan library selesai."

#. Translators: Progress message shown before dependency download begins.
msgid "Downloading libraries..."
msgstr "Mengunduh library..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while dependency download is in progress.
msgid "Downloading..."
msgstr "Mengunduh..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while checking the downloaded dependency package.
msgid "Verifying libraries..."
msgstr "Memverifikasi library..."

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency archive contains an unsafe path.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The library archive contains an unsafe path: {path}"
msgstr "Arsip library berisi jalur yang tidak aman: {path}"

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency archive would extract outside the target folder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The library archive contains a path outside the installation directory: "
"{path}"
msgstr "Arsip library berisi jalur di luar direktori instalasi: {path}"

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency package fails checksum verification.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Library checksum mismatch. Expected {expected}, got {actual}."
msgstr ""
"Checksum library tidak cocok. Nilai yang diharapkan: {expected}; nilai "
"aktual: {actual}."

#. Translators: Error shown when the updater cannot inspect the HTTPS peer certificate.
msgid "Unable to inspect the HTTPS peer certificate."
msgstr "Tidak dapat memeriksa sertifikat peer HTTPS."

#. Translators: Error shown when the HTTPS peer does not provide a certificate.
msgid "The HTTPS peer did not provide a certificate."
msgstr "Peer HTTPS tidak memberikan sertifikat."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"PyAudio {version} does not provide a wheel for this NVDA Python runtime: "
"{assetName}."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio {version} tidak menyediakan wheel untuk runtime Python NVDA ini: "
"{assetName}."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog for the "Talk With AI" feature (REAL-TIME conversation).
msgid "Talk With AI"
msgstr "Bicara dengan AI"

#. Translators: Choice label for the lowest reasoning setting in Talk With AI.
msgid "No Thinking"
msgstr "Tanpa Penalaran"

#. Translators: Choice label for low reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Rendah"

#. Translators: Choice label for medium reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Sedang"

#. Translators: Choice label for high reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "High"
msgstr "Tinggi"

#. Translators: Low-latency voice conversation model.
msgid "Gemini 3.8 Live"
msgstr "Gemini 3.8 Live"

#. Translators: Voice conversation model with configurable background reasoning.
msgid "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking"
msgstr "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking"

#. Translators: Previous voice conversation model, with its original thinking levels.
#. Translators: Previous Live model for Quick Speak, retaining its existing thinking settings.
msgid "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview"
msgstr "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview"

msgid ""
"PyAudio is not available. This feature requires a working PyAudio "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio tidak tersedia. Fitur ini memerlukan instalasi PyAudio yang "
"berfungsi."

#. Translators: Status shown after Talk With AI finishes enumerating audio devices.
msgid "Audio devices loaded"
msgstr "Perangkat audio telah dimuat"

msgid "No explicit audio devices found. System defaults will be used."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ditemukan perangkat audio khusus. Perangkat bawaan sistem akan "
"digunakan."

#. Translators: Group label for connection status in the Talk With AI dialog.
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. Translators: Initial status shown while Talk With AI enumerates audio devices.
msgid "Loading audio devices..."
msgstr "Memuat perangkat audio..."

#. Translators: Status label. {status} is replaced with the current Talk With AI status.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Status: {status}"
msgstr "Status: {status}"

#. Translators: Group label for Talk With AI controls.
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kontrol"

#. Translators: Button to start the voice conversation.
msgid "Start Conversation"
msgstr "Mulai percakapan"

#. Translators: Button to stop the voice conversation.
msgid "Stop Conversation"
msgstr "Hentikan percakapan"

#. Translators: Toggle button label indicating microphone is ON.
#. Translators: Toggle button label indicating microphone state.
msgid "Microphone: ON"
msgstr "Mikrofon: AKTIF"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the microphone input device.
msgid "Microphone input device:"
msgstr "Perangkat input mikrofon:"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the audio output device.
msgid "&Speaker output device:"
msgstr "Perangkat output &speaker:"

#. Translators: Checkbox to enable grounding with Google Search in Talk With AI.
msgid "Grounding with Google Search"
msgstr "Grounding dengan Google Search"

#. Translators: Opt-in toggle for sending periodic screen frames to the assistant.
msgid "Share screen with AI"
msgstr "Bagikan layar dengan AI"

#. Translators: Label for the model used for voice conversations, separate from Quick Speak.
msgid "Conversation &model:"
msgstr "&Model percakapan:"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "&Thinking level:"
msgstr "&Tingkat penalaran:"

#. Translators: Label for the Talk With AI playback volume slider.
msgid "Volume:"
msgstr "Volume:"

#. Translators: Informational label. {voiceName} is replaced with the selected Gemini voice.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Assistant voice: {voiceName}"
msgstr "Suara asisten: {voiceName}"

#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI connects successfully.
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Terhubung"

msgid "Microphone: OFF"
msgstr "Mikrofon: NONAKTIF"

msgid "Screen sharing is unavailable while Screen Curtain is enabled"
msgstr "Berbagi layar tidak tersedia saat Tirai Layar diaktifkan"

msgid "Screen sharing enabled"
msgstr "Berbagi layar diaktifkan"

msgid "Screen sharing disabled"
msgstr "Berbagi layar dinonaktifkan"

#. Translators: Status announced when Screen Curtain stops an active screen-sharing stream.
msgid "Screen sharing stopped because Screen Curtain is enabled"
msgstr "Berbagi layar dihentikan karena Tirai Layar diaktifkan"

#. Translators: Status announced after repeated screen capture failures stop screen sharing.
msgid "Screen sharing stopped because screen capture failed"
msgstr "Berbagi layar dihentikan karena pengambilan layar gagal"

#. Translators: Dependency error detail. {baseMessage} is the main error and {errorDetail} is the import exception.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{baseMessage}\n"
"\n"
"Import detail: {errorDetail}"
msgstr ""
"{baseMessage}\n"
"\n"
"Detail impor: {errorDetail}"

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI is connecting.
msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "Menghubungkan..."

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI is disconnecting.
msgid "Disconnecting..."
msgstr "Memutuskan koneksi..."

#. Translators: Error shown when Talk With AI cannot play received audio.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio playback failed: {error}"
msgstr "Pemutaran audio gagal: {error}"

msgid "Audio output device is no longer available."
msgstr "Perangkat output audio tidak lagi tersedia."

#. Translators: The model may still be reasoning after an audio turn finishes.
msgid "AI processing"
msgstr "AI sedang memproses"

#. Translators: All model processing is complete; the conversation remains connected.
msgid "AI ready for input"
msgstr "AI siap menerima masukan"

#. Translators: Status shown when the first Talk With AI connection attempt failed.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connection failed. Retrying in {seconds:.1f}s"
msgstr "Koneksi gagal. Mencoba ulang dalam {seconds:.1f} detik"

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI waits before reconnecting.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connection lost. Retrying in {seconds:.1f}s"
msgstr "Koneksi terputus. Mencoba ulang dalam {seconds:.1f}s"

#. Translators: Error shown when Talk With AI cannot initialize its audio or session runtime.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Talk With AI could not start: {error}"
msgstr "Talk With AI tidak dapat dimulai: {error}"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "Kesalahan tidak diketahui"

#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI is ready for a new session.
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Siap"

#. Translators: Message shown when generated audio was saved but could not be opened automatically.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio generated, but failed to play automatically: {error}"
msgstr "Audio dihasilkan, namun gagal diputar secara otomatis: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of an informational message dialog.
msgid "Info"
msgstr "Info"

msgid "No selected text was found."
msgstr "Tidak ditemukan teks yang dipilih."

msgid "Quick Speak cannot read text from a protected field."
msgstr "Quick Speak tidak dapat membaca teks dari bidang yang dilindungi."

msgid "The clipboard does not contain text."
msgstr "Clipboard tidak berisi teks."

msgid "No text was provided for Quick Speak."
msgstr "Tidak ada teks yang diberikan untuk Quick Speak."

msgid ""
"No Gemini API key is configured. Set it in NVDA settings before using Quick "
"Speak."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API Gemini belum dikonfigurasi. Atur di pengaturan NVDA sebelum "
"menggunakan Quick Speak."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak audio could not be played. Check NVDA's audio output device."
msgstr ""
"Audio Quick Speak tidak dapat diputar. Periksa perangkat output audio NVDA."

msgid "Quick Speak failed. Check your connection and try again."
msgstr "Quick Speak gagal. Periksa koneksi Anda dan coba lagi."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not authenticate. Check the Gemini API key in NVDA "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak tidak dapat melakukan autentikasi. Periksa kunci API Gemini di "
"pengaturan NVDA."

msgid ""
"The Gemini API limit was reached. Wait a moment, then try Quick Speak again."
msgstr ""
"Batas API Gemini telah tercapai. Tunggu sebentar, lalu coba Quick Speak lagi."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not connect to Gemini. Check your internet connection and "
"try again."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak tidak dapat terhubung ke Gemini. Periksa koneksi internet Anda "
"dan coba lagi."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not generate speech. Try again or choose another model in "
"NVDA settings."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak tidak dapat membuat ucapan. Coba lagi atau pilih model lain di "
"pengaturan NVDA."

#. Translators: The title of the main dialog window for generating speech.
msgid "Native Speech Generation (Gemini TTS)"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation (Gemini TTS)"

#. Translators: Model option for Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite text-to-speech.
msgid "Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS"
msgstr "Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS"

#. Translators: Description of the default model in the speech generation dialog.
msgid "Fast, efficient speech generation for everyday reading and narration."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan ucapan yang cepat dan efisien untuk membaca dan narasi sehari-hari."

#. Translators: Model option for Gemini 3.8 Flash text-to-speech.
msgid "Flash 3.8 TTS"
msgstr "Flash 3.8 TTS"

#. Translators: Description of the creative Gemini 3.8 speech model.
msgid ""
"Expressive speech generation for narration, acting, and multi-speaker "
"dialogue."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan ucapan yang ekspresif untuk narasi, akting, dan dialog multi-"
"pembicara."

#. Translators: Model option for the previous Gemini Flash text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Flash 3.1 Preview"
msgstr "Flash 3.1 Preview"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Flash 3.1 Preview model.
msgid "Powerful, low-latency speech generation, very good for short audio."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan ucapan yang kuat dan berlatensi rendah, sangat cocok untuk audio "
"pendek."

#. Translators: Model option for the older Gemini Flash text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Flash 2.5"
msgstr "Flash 2.5"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Flash 2.5 model.
msgid "Standard quality, responsive speech generation."
msgstr "Pembuatan ucapan yang responsif dengan kualitas standar."

#. Translators: Model option for the Gemini Pro text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Pro 2.5 (High Quality, need paid API)"
msgstr "Pro 2.5 (Kualitas Tinggi, memerlukan API berbayar)"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Pro 2.5 model.
msgid "Premium speech generation with more realistic voices."
msgstr "Pembuatan ucapan premium dengan suara yang lebih realistis."

#. Translators: Label for the text area where user inputs text to be converted to speech.
msgid "&Type text to convert here:"
msgstr "&Masukkan teks yang ingin Anda ubah menjadi audio:"

#. Translators: Label for optional instructions on how the speech should be spoken (e.g. "Happy", "Sad").
msgid "&Style instructions (optional):"
msgstr "&Instruksi gaya bicara (opsional):"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the AI model to use for generation.
msgid "Select &Model:"
msgstr "Pilih &Model:"

#. Translators: Radio button to select single speaker mode.
msgid "Single-speaker"
msgstr "Satu pembicara"

#. Translators: Radio button to select multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Multi-speaker (2)"
msgstr "Multi-pembicara (2)"

#. Translators: Checkbox to show advanced settings like Temperature.
msgid "Advanced Settings (&Temperature)"
msgstr "Pengaturan lanjutan (&Temperatur)"

#. Translators: Label for the temperature slider which controls creativity of the AI.
msgid "Temperature:"
msgstr "Temperatur:"

#. Translators: Button to start generating the speech audio.
#. Translators: Button label restored after speech generation finishes.
msgid "&Generate Speech"
msgstr "&Hasilkan Audio"

#. Translators: Button to play the generated audio.
msgid "&Play"
msgstr "&Putar"

#. Translators: Button to save the generated audio to a file.
msgid "Save &Audio"
msgstr "Simpan &Audio"

#. Translators: Button to open the real-time conversation dialog.
msgid "Talk With &AI"
msgstr "Bicara dengan &AI"

#. Translators: Button to open settings specifically for configuring the API key.
msgid "API Key Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Kunci API"

#. Translators: Button that opens a web browser to view available voices in Google AI Studio.
msgid "View voices in AI Studio"
msgstr "Lihat suara di AI Studio"

#. Translators: Button to close the Native Speech Generation dialog.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Tutup"

#. Translators: Label for selecting a voice in single speaker mode.
msgid "Select &Voice:"
msgstr "Pilih &Suara:"

#. Translators: Temporary item shown while the add-on prepares the voice list.
msgid "Loading voices..."
msgstr "Memuat suara..."

#. Translators: Opens the library for the single narrator; applies only to TTS generation.
msgid "View voice &library"
msgstr "Lihat pustaka &suara"

#. Translators: Label for entering the first speaker name in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 1 Name:"
msgstr "Nama Pembicara 1:"

#. Translators: Default name for the first speaker in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Fallback speaker name used when the first speaker field is blank.
msgid "Speaker1"
msgstr "Pembicara 1"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the first speaker voice in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Label for selecting the voice assigned to speaker 1 in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 1 &voice:"
msgstr "&Suara pembicara 1:"

msgid "Speaker 1 voice &library"
msgstr "&Pustaka suara pembicara 1"

#. Translators: Label for entering the second speaker name in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 2 Name:"
msgstr "Nama Pembicara 2:"

#. Translators: Default name for the second speaker in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Fallback speaker name used when the second speaker field is blank.
msgid "Speaker2"
msgstr "Pembicara 2"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the second speaker voice in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Label for selecting the voice assigned to speaker 2 in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 2 v&oice:"
msgstr "S&uara pembicara 2:"

msgid "Speaker 2 voice li&brary"
msgstr "Pusta&ka suara pembicara 2"

#. Translators: Opens keyboard-readable instructions for writing a two-speaker script.
msgid "Script &Help"
msgstr "&Bantuan Skrip"

#. Translators: Speaker identities used in library labels and announcements.
msgid "Narrator"
msgstr "Narator"

msgid "Speaker 1"
msgstr "Pembicara 1"

msgid "Speaker 2"
msgstr "Pembicara 2"

#. Translators: No TTS library override is selected for this speaker.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker}: use library voice for Gemini 3.8 (none selected)"
msgstr "{speaker}: gunakan suara pustaka untuk Gemini 3.8 (belum dipilih)"

#. Translators: Speaker-specific TTS override; unchecking returns to the built-in voice picker.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker}: use library voice for Gemini 3.8: {name}"
msgstr "{speaker}: gunakan suara pustaka untuk Gemini 3.8: {name}"

#. Translators: Selection works now but cannot be restored after NVDA restarts.
msgid "Library preferences apply for this session but could not be saved."
msgstr "Preferensi pustaka berlaku untuk sesi ini tetapi tidak dapat disimpan."

msgid "Select a Gemini 3.8 TTS model to use the voice library."
msgstr "Pilih model Gemini 3.8 TTS untuk menggunakan pustaka suara."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker} generation voice selected: {name}"
msgstr "Suara pembuatan untuk {speaker} dipilih: {name}"

msgid ""
"For Gemini 3.8, write one spoken turn per line as Name: text. Use the "
"speaker names exactly as entered, including capitalization. Each nonblank "
"line needs a name and spoken text; blank lines are ignored. Names must be "
"different even when capitalization is ignored, and cannot contain a colon. "
"Put delivery directions in Style instructions; they apply to both speakers."
msgstr ""
"Untuk Gemini 3.8, tulis satu giliran bicara per baris dengan format Nama: "
"teks. Gunakan nama pembicara persis seperti yang dimasukkan, termasuk huruf "
"besar dan kecil. Setiap baris yang tidak kosong harus berisi nama dan teks "
"yang diucapkan; baris kosong diabaikan. Nama harus berbeda meskipun huruf "
"besar dan kecil diabaikan, dan tidak boleh berisi titik dua. Tulis arahan "
"penyampaian di Instruksi gaya; arahan itu berlaku untuk kedua pembicara."

#. Translators: Instructions for multi-speaker scripts when an older model is selected.
msgid ""
"Label each speaker's dialogue with the matching speaker name followed by a "
"colon."
msgstr ""
"Beri label dialog setiap pembicara dengan nama pembicara yang sesuai, "
"diikuti titik dua."

#. Translators: A two-line script example. Keep each speaker placeholder followed by a colon.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{speaker1}: Hello!\n"
"{speaker2}: Good morning!"
msgstr ""
"{speaker1}: Halo!\n"
"{speaker2}: Selamat pagi!"

#. Translators: Title of the multi-speaker script instructions dialog.
msgid "Multi-speaker script help"
msgstr "Bantuan skrip multi-pembicara"

#. Translators: Announcement after the advanced settings panel becomes visible.
msgid "Advanced settings shown."
msgstr "Pengaturan lanjutan ditampilkan."

#. Translators: Announcement after the advanced settings panel is hidden.
msgid "Advanced settings hidden."
msgstr "Pengaturan lanjutan disembunyikan."

#. Translators: Announcement after multi-speaker generation mode is selected.
msgid "Multi-speaker mode. Speaker 1 and Speaker 2 controls shown."
msgstr "Mode multi-pembicara. Kontrol Pembicara 1 dan Pembicara 2 ditampilkan."

#. Translators: Announcement after single-speaker generation mode is selected.
msgid "Single-speaker mode."
msgstr "Mode satu pembicara."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The stored Gemini API key could not be decrypted on this Windows user or "
"machine. Please enter it again in NVDA settings, or define {envVarName} in "
"the environment."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API Gemini yang tersimpan tidak dapat didekripsi pada pengguna atau "
"mesin Windows ini. Silakan masukkan kembali di pengaturan NVDA, atau atur "
"{envVarName} sebagai variabel lingkungan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"No Gemini API key is configured. Set it in NVDA settings, or define "
"{envVarName} in the environment."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada kunci API Gemini yang dikonfigurasi. Atur di pengaturan NVDA, atau "
"atur {envVarName} sebagai variabel lingkungan."

#. Translators: Error shown if the optional Talk With AI dialog module cannot be loaded.
msgid "Talk With AI module is missing."
msgstr "Modul Bicara dengan AI tidak ditemukan."

#. Translators: Warning shown when Talk With AI is opened while multi-speaker mode is selected.
msgid ""
"Talk With AI currently does not support multi-speaker mode. Please select "
"Single-speaker."
msgstr ""
"Bicara dengan AI saat ini belum mendukung mode multi-pembicara. Harap pilih "
"Satu pembicara."

msgid "Feature Limitation"
msgstr "Batasan Fitur"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to open Talk With AI: {error}"
msgstr "Gagal membuka Bicara dengan AI: {error}"

msgid ""
"This library voice requires Gemini 3.8 TTS. Select a 3.8 model or uncheck "
"the library voice."
msgstr ""
"Suara pustaka ini memerlukan Gemini 3.8 TTS. Pilih model 3.8 atau hapus "
"centang suara pustaka."

#. Translators: Error shown when the user tries to generate speech without entering text.
msgid "Please enter text to generate."
msgstr "Harap masukkan teks terlebih dahulu."

#. Translators: Temporary Generate button label while speech generation is running.
msgid "Generating..."
msgstr "Sedang memproses..."

#. Translators: Title of a speech generation input validation error.
msgid "Check speech input"
msgstr "Periksa masukan ucapan"

#. Translators: Error shown when a voice is missing for one of the speakers being generated.
msgid "Select a voice for each speaker, then try again."
msgstr "Pilih suara untuk setiap pembicara, lalu coba lagi."

#. Translators: Error shown when the text or speaker settings cannot be sent for generation.
msgid "Check the text and speaker settings, then try again."
msgstr "Periksa teks dan pengaturan pembicara, lalu coba lagi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Speaker {number} must have a different name from the other speaker, even "
"when capitalization is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Pembicara {number} harus memiliki nama yang berbeda dari pembicara lainnya, "
"meskipun huruf besar dan kecil diabaikan."

#. Translators: Validation error for a missing or invalid speaker name.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Enter a name for Speaker {number} without a colon or line break."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan nama untuk Pembicara {number} tanpa titik dua atau baris baru."

#. Translators: Validation error for a script line with a speaker but no spoken text.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Line {line}: enter spoken text after the speaker name and colon."
msgstr ""
"Baris {line}: masukkan teks yang diucapkan setelah nama pembicara dan titik "
"dua."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Line {line}: start with '{speaker1}:' or '{speaker2}:' using the exact "
"speaker name."
msgstr ""
"Baris {line}: awali dengan '{speaker1}:' atau '{speaker2}:' menggunakan nama "
"pembicara yang persis sama."

#. Translators: Status announcement made when speech generation starts.
msgid "Generating speech, please wait..."
msgstr "Sedang menghasilkan audio, harap tunggu..."

#. Translators: Status announcement made when speech generation fails.
msgid "Failed to generate audio."
msgstr "Gagal menghasilkan audio."

#. Translators: Status announcement made when speech generation succeeds.
msgid "Generation complete."
msgstr "Pembuatan audio selesai."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to generate speech: {error}"
msgstr "Gagal menghasilkan ucapan: {error}"

msgid "An error occurred during generation."
msgstr "Terjadi kesalahan selama menghasilkan audio."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "An unexpected error occurred: {error}"
msgstr "Terjadi kesalahan yang tidak terduga: {error}"

#. Translators: File type filter for saving generated audio. The placeholders contain the format name and extension.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{formatName} files (*{extension})|*{extension}"
msgstr "File {formatName} (*{extension})|*{extension}"

msgid "Save Audio File"
msgstr "Simpan file audio"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio saved to {path}"
msgstr "Audio disimpan ke {path}"

msgid "Success"
msgstr "Berhasil"

#. Translators: Error shown when the chosen filename extension does not match the generated audio format.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This audio must be saved with the {extension} extension."
msgstr "Audio ini harus disimpan dengan ekstensi {extension}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to save audio: {error}"
msgstr "Gagal menyimpan audio: {error}"

msgid "Sample not available"
msgstr "Sampel suara tidak tersedia"

msgid "Playing voice sample"
msgstr "Memainkan sampel suara"

msgid "Failed to play sample"
msgstr "Gagal memutar sampel suara"

#. Translators: Announcement after the list of available voices is ready.
msgid "Voice list loaded."
msgstr "Daftar suara telah dimuat."

#. Translators: Choose how to create a custom voice.
msgid "Create voice"
msgstr "Buat suara"

msgid ""
"Choose how to create your voice. Both options require a Gemini API key from "
"a project with billing enabled (paid tier)."
msgstr ""
"Pilih cara membuat suara Anda. Kedua opsi memerlukan kunci API Gemini dari "
"proyek dengan penagihan aktif (tingkat berbayar)."

msgid ""
"Voice &Design\n"
"Create a voice from a text description of its age,\n"
"tone, accent, and delivery."
msgstr ""
"&Desain Suara\n"
"Buat suara dari deskripsi teks tentang usia,\n"
"nada, aksen, dan cara penyampaiannya."

msgid ""
"Voice &Replication\n"
"Create a voice from a reference recording,\n"
"with the speaker's recorded consent verified by Google."
msgstr ""
"&Replikasi Suara\n"
"Buat suara dari rekaman referensi,\n"
"dengan persetujuan terekam dari pembicara yang diverifikasi oleh Google."

msgid "&Gemini API Key:"
msgstr "&Kunci API Gemini:"

#. Translators: Checkbox to toggle visibility of the API key (show/hide characters).
msgid "Show API Key"
msgstr "Tampilkan kunci API"

#. Translators: Group label for Quick Speak settings.
msgid "Quick Speak"
msgstr "Quick Speak"

#. Translators: Recommended low-latency model for Quick Speak.
msgid "Gemini 3.8 Live (recommended)"
msgstr "Gemini 3.8 Live (direkomendasikan)"

#. Translators: Low-latency native audio model for Quick Speak.
msgid "Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio"
msgstr "Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio"

#. Translators: Gemini text-to-speech model choice for Quick Speak.
msgid "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview"
msgstr "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview"

#. Translators: Gemini text-to-speech model choice for Quick Speak.
msgid "Gemini 2.5 Flash TTS Preview"
msgstr "Gemini 2.5 Flash TTS Preview"

#. Translators: Gemini text-to-speech model choice for Quick Speak.
msgid "Gemini 2.5 Pro TTS Preview (need paid API)"
msgstr "Gemini 2.5 Pro TTS Preview (memerlukan API berbayar)"

msgid "Quick Speak &model:"
msgstr "&Model Quick Speak:"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the Gemini voice used by Quick Speak.
msgid "Quick Speak &voice:"
msgstr "&Suara Quick Speak:"

#. Translators: Label for the Quick Speak playback volume slider.
msgid "Quick Speak &volume:"
msgstr "&Volume Quick Speak:"

msgid "Quick Speak volume"
msgstr "Volume Quick Speak"

msgid "Pronunciation and &style instructions:"
msgstr "Instruksi pelafalan dan &gaya:"

#. Translators: Button starting a process to help user get an API key (opens a website).
msgid "&How to get API Key..."
msgstr "&Cara mendapatkan kunci API..."

#. Translators: Button to force a reinstallation of external dependencies (Python libraries).
msgid "&Reinstall Libraries"
msgstr "&Instal ulang library"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The stored API key could not be decrypted on this Windows user or machine. "
"Using {envVarName} from the environment instead. Enter a new key here to "
"replace it."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API yang tersimpan tidak dapat didekripsi pada pengguna atau perangkat "
"Windows ini. Sebagai gantinya, variabel lingkungan {envVarName} akan "
"digunakan. Masukkan kunci baru di sini untuk menggantikannya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The stored API key could not be decrypted on this Windows user or machine. "
"Enter a new key here, or set {envVarName} in the environment."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API yang tersimpan tidak dapat didekripsi pada pengguna atau perangkat "
"Windows ini. Masukkan kunci baru di sini, atau atur {envVarName} sebagai "
"variabel lingkungan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Using {envVarName} from the environment. Saving a key here will override it."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan variabel lingkungan {envVarName}. Menyimpan kunci di sini akan "
"menimpanya."

#. Translators: Error shown if Windows DPAPI storage fails while saving the API key.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to save the Gemini API key securely: {error}"
msgstr "Gagal menyimpan kunci API Gemini dengan aman: {error}"

#. Translators: Error shown when a Quick Speak model or voice has not been selected.
msgid "Select both a Quick Speak model and voice."
msgstr "Pilih model dan suara Quick Speak."

#. Translators: Title of the form for creating a custom voice from a description.
msgid "Voice Design"
msgstr "Desain Suara"

msgid ""
"Voice Design requires a Gemini API key from a project with billing enabled "
"(paid tier). Free-tier API keys cannot create voices. Describe the voice's "
"age, tone, accent, and delivery. Create voice uses API quota and saves the "
"voice in your Google project immediately. Closing the library does not "
"cancel creation or delete the voice."
msgstr ""
"Desain Suara memerlukan kunci API Gemini dari proyek dengan penagihan aktif "
"(tingkat berbayar). Kunci API tingkat gratis tidak dapat membuat suara. "
"Jelaskan usia, nada, aksen, dan cara penyampaian suara. Buat suara "
"menggunakan kuota API dan langsung menyimpan suara di proyek Google Anda. "
"Menutup pustaka tidak membatalkan pembuatan atau menghapus suara."

#. Translators: Required display name of the new designed voice.
#. Translators: Name of the new replicated voice.
msgid "Voice &name:"
msgstr "&Nama suara:"

msgid "Voice &description:"
msgstr "&Deskripsi suara:"

#. Translators: Optional BCP-47 language tag for catalog metadata.
msgid "&Language tag (optional, e.g. id-ID):"
msgstr "Tag &bahasa (opsional, misalnya id-ID):"

msgid "&Gender:"
msgstr "&Gender:"

#. Translators: Voices whose catalog entry has no language tag.
msgid "Unspecified"
msgstr "Tidak ditentukan"

msgid "Female"
msgstr "Perempuan"

msgid "Male"
msgstr "Laki-laki"

msgid "Neutral"
msgstr "Netral"

#. Translators: Explicitly create and store a voice using the API.
msgid "&Create voice"
msgstr "B&uat suara"

#. Translators: Required voice name validation.
msgid "Enter a voice name, up to 100 characters."
msgstr "Masukkan nama suara, maksimal 100 karakter."

msgid "Enter a voice description, up to 2000 characters."
msgstr "Masukkan deskripsi suara, maksimal 2000 karakter."

msgid "Enter a language tag such as id-ID, or leave it blank."
msgstr "Masukkan tag bahasa seperti id-ID, atau biarkan kosong."

msgid "Voice library"
msgstr "Pustaka suara"

msgid ""
"Select a voice and press Space or Enter to play its sample. Use Generate "
"preview to create audio from the preview text using API quota."
msgstr ""
"Pilih suara lalu tekan Spasi atau Enter untuk memutar sampelnya. Gunakan "
"Hasilkan pratinjau untuk membuat audio dari teks pratinjau dengan kuota API."

#. Translators: Search field in the voice library; searches names, language, accent, and descriptions.
msgid "&Search voices:"
msgstr "&Cari suara:"

msgid "Voice &type:"
msgstr "&Jenis suara:"

#. Translators: Voice library type filters, in order: all, built-in catalog, designed, replicated.
msgid "All voices"
msgstr "Semua suara"

#. Translators: Readable voice metadata; the ID distinguishes voices with identical display names.
msgid "Prebuilt"
msgstr "Bawaan"

msgid "Designed"
msgstr "Desain"

msgid "Replicated"
msgstr "Replikasi"

#. Translators: Filter by the language tag in the voice catalog, for example id-ID or en-US.
msgid "&Language:"
msgstr "&Bahasa:"

msgid "G&ender:"
msgstr "G&ender:"

msgid "&Pitch:"
msgstr "&Tinggi nada:"

msgid "Perso&na:"
msgstr "Perso&na:"

msgid "Use c&ase:"
msgstr "Kegun&aan:"

#. Translators: Native list of voices matching the search and filter.
msgid "Available &voices:"
msgstr "&Suara yang tersedia:"

msgid "Voice &details:"
msgstr "&Detail suara:"

#. Translators: Text synthesized only when the user activates Generate preview.
msgid "Preview te&xt:"
msgstr "Te&ks pratinjau:"

#. Translators: Default short utterance for generated previews. Users can edit it in any language.
msgid "Hello! This is a short preview of my voice."
msgstr "Halo! Ini adalah pratinjau singkat suara saya."

#. Translators: Read-only status of voice library loading, filtering, and preview.
msgid "Status:"
msgstr "Status:"

#. Translators: Reload the complete catalog from Google.
msgid "&Refresh"
msgstr "&Muat ulang"

#. Translators: Choose Voice Design or Voice Replication.
msgid "Ne&w voice"
msgstr "Suara bar&u"

#. Translators: Explicitly generate a preview of the selected voice using API quota.
msgid "&Generate preview"
msgstr "&Hasilkan pratinjau"

#. Translators: Creates a new voice by modifying the selected voice; the original is unchanged.
msgid "Re&mix selected voice"
msgstr "Rem&iks suara terpilih"

#. Translators: Stop playing or waiting for a downloaded sample.
msgid "St&op sample"
msgstr "Hentikan sam&pel"

#. Translators: Apply the selected voice to the speaker whose library was opened.
msgid "&Use selected voice"
msgstr "&Gunakan suara terpilih"

#. Translators: Editing the preview text stops playback or discards a pending response.
#. Translators: Selecting another voice cancels preview; native selection speech identifies the voice.
#. Translators: Playback or retrieval of the sample was stopped locally.
msgid "Sample stopped."
msgstr "Sampel dihentikan."

#. Translators: Show all catalog voices regardless of language metadata.
msgid "All languages"
msgstr "Semua bahasa"

#. Translators: Catalog filter choices: no restriction, or missing metadata.
msgid "All"
msgstr "Semua"

#. Translators: Number of voices matching the current filters; selection is never changed automatically.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} voices found."
msgstr "{count} suara ditemukan."

msgid ""
"The previous voice is not in these results. Choose a voice or change the "
"filters."
msgstr "Suara sebelumnya tidak ada di hasil ini. Pilih suara atau ubah filter."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Name: {name}\n"
"ID: {id}\n"
"Type: {type}\n"
"Language: {language}\n"
"Accent: {accent}\n"
"Gender: {gender}\n"
"Pitch: {pitch}\n"
"Persona: {persona}\n"
"Use case: {context}\n"
"Description: {description}"
msgstr ""
"Nama: {name}\n"
"ID: {id}\n"
"Jenis: {type}\n"
"Bahasa: {language}\n"
"Aksen: {accent}\n"
"Gender: {gender}\n"
"Tinggi nada: {pitch}\n"
"Persona: {persona}\n"
"Kegunaan: {context}\n"
"Deskripsi: {description}"

#. Translators: Avoid overlapping catalog refresh with creation of a persistent voice.
msgid "Voice creation is still in progress."
msgstr "Pembuatan suara masih berlangsung."

#. Keep the focused button enabled; ignore repeated activation until this request completes.
#. Translators: Voice catalog request is in progress; existing results remain usable.
msgid "Loading voices. Current results remain available."
msgstr "Memuat suara. Hasil saat ini tetap tersedia."

#. Translators: The explicit create request is being sent; closing cannot cancel the server operation.
msgid ""
"Creating voice using API quota. It will be saved in your Google project."
msgstr ""
"Membuat suara menggunakan kuota API. Suara akan disimpan di proyek Google "
"Anda."

msgid ""
"Checking recordings and creating voice using API quota. Google will verify "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa rekaman dan membuat suara menggunakan kuota API. Google akan "
"memverifikasi persetujuan."

msgid ""
"Select a prebuilt or designed voice to remix. Replicated voices cannot be "
"remixed."
msgstr ""
"Pilih suara bawaan atau desain untuk diremiks. Suara replikasi tidak dapat "
"diremiks."

#. Translators: Status while a remixed voice is being created.
msgid ""
"Remixing voice using API quota. It will be saved in your Google project."
msgstr ""
"Meremiks suara menggunakan kuota API. Suara akan disimpan di proyek Google "
"Anda."

msgid ""
"Reference recording must be a readable 24 kHz mono 16-bit PCM WAV file of 10–"
"30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Rekaman referensi harus berupa file WAV PCM 16-bit mono 24 kHz yang dapat "
"dibaca, berdurasi 10–30 detik."

msgid ""
"Consent recording must be a readable 24 kHz mono 16-bit PCM WAV file, up to "
"60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Rekaman persetujuan harus berupa file WAV PCM 16-bit mono 24 kHz yang dapat "
"dibaca, maksimal 60 detik."

msgid ""
"Nothing was uploaded. Open New voice, then Voice Replication to choose the "
"files again."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada yang diunggah. Buka Suara baru, lalu Replikasi Suara untuk memilih "
"file lagi."

msgid ""
"Could not confirm voice creation. Refresh the library before trying again; "
"the voice may already have been saved. Check billing, API access, quota, "
"and, for replication, the consent recording if it is missing."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan suara tidak dapat dikonfirmasi. Muat ulang pustaka sebelum mencoba "
"lagi; suara mungkin sudah tersimpan. Periksa penagihan, akses API, kuota, "
"dan, untuk replikasi, rekaman persetujuan jika tidak ada."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Voice {name} created and saved in Google. Filters cleared to show it. Press "
"Space or Enter on the voice to hear its sample, or use Use selected voice."
msgstr ""
"Suara {name} dibuat dan disimpan di Google. Filter dikosongkan agar suara "
"ini terlihat. Tekan Spasi atau Enter pada suara untuk mendengar sampelnya, "
"atau gunakan Gunakan suara terpilih."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Voice {name} created and saved in Google. Filters cleared to show it. Use "
"Generate preview to hear it using API quota, or Use selected voice."
msgstr ""
"Suara {name} dibuat dan disimpan di Google. Filter dikosongkan agar suara "
"ini terlihat. Gunakan Hasilkan pratinjau untuk mendengarnya dengan kuota "
"API, atau Gunakan suara terpilih."

#. Translators: The server operation succeeded but local metadata persistence failed.
msgid "The local cache could not be saved."
msgstr "Cache lokal tidak dapat disimpan."

msgid ""
"Could not refresh voices. Previous results kept. Check the API key or "
"connection and retry."
msgstr ""
"Suara tidak dapat dimuat ulang. Hasil sebelumnya dipertahankan. Periksa "
"kunci API atau koneksi, lalu coba lagi."

#. Translators: Voices loaded successfully but could not be persisted in this NVDA session.
msgid "Voices loaded for this session. The cache could not be saved."
msgstr "Suara dimuat untuk sesi ini. Cache tidak dapat disimpan."

#. Translators: A sample shortcut was used without a selected result.
msgid "Select a voice first."
msgstr "Pilih suara terlebih dahulu."

#. Translators: NVDA is not allowing temporary audio files in this session.
msgid "Samples are unavailable while file saving is disabled."
msgstr "Sampel tidak tersedia saat penyimpanan file dinonaktifkan."

#. Translators: Fetching an existing sample, without synthesizing speech.
msgid "Loading sample..."
msgstr "Memuat sampel..."

msgid ""
"Sample not available for this voice. Use Generate preview to create one "
"using API quota."
msgstr ""
"Sampel tidak tersedia untuk suara ini. Gunakan Hasilkan pratinjau untuk "
"membuatnya dengan kuota API."

#. Translators: Validation for the short text used to generate a missing voice sample.
msgid "Enter preview text, up to 300 characters."
msgstr "Masukkan teks pratinjau, maksimal 300 karakter."

#. Translators: Generating a preview consumes the user's API quota.
msgid "Generating preview using API quota..."
msgstr "Menghasilkan pratinjau menggunakan kuota API..."

#. Translators: Retrieving, generating, or playing the voice sample failed.
msgid "Could not play the sample. Please try again."
msgstr "Sampel tidak dapat diputar. Silakan coba lagi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Playing sample for {name}."
msgstr "Memutar sampel untuk {name}."

#. Translators: The voice preview has finished playing.
msgid "Sample complete."
msgstr "Sampel selesai."

#. Translators: Local cancellation cannot undo a request already submitted to Google.
msgid "A submitted generation request may still use API quota."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan pembuatan yang sudah dikirim mungkin tetap menggunakan kuota API."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog that creates a new voice by modifying an existing one.
msgid "Voice Remix"
msgstr "Remiks Suara"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Voice Remix creates a new voice based on {name}. The original voice is not "
"changed. It requires a Gemini API key from a project with billing enabled "
"(paid tier). Describe one or two changes, such as age, pitch, energy, "
"pacing, tone, or accent. Create voice uses API quota and saves the new voice "
"in your Google project immediately. Closing the library does not cancel "
"creation or delete the voice."
msgstr ""
"Remiks Suara membuat suara baru berdasarkan {name}. Suara aslinya tidak "
"diubah. Fitur ini memerlukan kunci API Gemini dari proyek dengan penagihan "
"aktif (tingkat berbayar). Jelaskan satu atau dua perubahan, seperti usia, "
"tinggi nada, energi, tempo, nada bicara, atau aksen. Buat suara menggunakan "
"kuota API dan langsung menyimpan suara baru di proyek Google Anda. Menutup "
"pustaka tidak membatalkan pembuatan atau menghapus suara."

#. Translators: Read-only field showing the voice that will be remixed.
msgid "&Base voice:"
msgstr "Suara &dasar:"

#. Translators: Optional name for the new remixed voice.
msgid "New voice &name (optional):"
msgstr "&Nama suara baru (opsional):"

#. Translators: Field describing how the base voice should change.
msgid "&Changes to make:"
msgstr "&Perubahan yang diinginkan:"

#. Translators: Button that submits a voice remix request.
msgid "Create &voice"
msgstr "&Buat suara"

#. Translators: Validation error for an overly long remixed voice name.
msgid "Enter a voice name of up to 100 characters, or leave it blank."
msgstr "Masukkan nama suara maksimal 100 karakter, atau biarkan kosong."

#. Translators: Validation error when remix instructions are missing or too long.
msgid "Describe the changes to make, up to 2000 characters."
msgstr "Jelaskan perubahan yang diinginkan, maksimal 2000 karakter."

msgid "Voice Replication"
msgstr "Replikasi Suara"

msgid ""
"Voice Replication requires a Gemini API key from a project with billing "
"enabled (paid tier). Free-tier API keys cannot create voices. Use two real "
"recordings from the same adult speaker. This version accepts 24 kHz mono 16-"
"bit PCM WAV files: reference speech of 10–30 seconds and a consent recording "
"of up to 60 seconds. Record the exact statement below. Create voice uploads "
"both recordings to Google for verification, uses API quota, and saves the "
"voice in your Google project. Closing the library does not cancel creation "
"or delete the voice."
msgstr ""
"Replikasi Suara memerlukan kunci API Gemini dari proyek dengan penagihan "
"aktif (tingkat berbayar). Kunci API tingkat gratis tidak dapat membuat "
"suara. Gunakan dua rekaman asli dari pembicara dewasa yang sama. Versi ini "
"menerima file WAV PCM 16-bit mono 24 kHz: ucapan referensi berdurasi 10–30 "
"detik dan rekaman persetujuan maksimal 60 detik. Rekam pernyataan di bawah "
"ini persis seperti tertulis. Buat suara mengunggah kedua rekaman ke Google "
"untuk verifikasi, menggunakan kuota API, dan menyimpan suara di proyek "
"Google Anda. Menutup pustaka tidak membatalkan pembuatan atau menghapus "
"suara."

msgid "Consent statement &language:"
msgstr "&Bahasa pernyataan persetujuan:"

msgid "Indonesian"
msgstr "Bahasa Indonesia"

msgid "English"
msgstr "Bahasa Inggris"

msgid "Statement to &record:"
msgstr "Pernyataan yang &direkam:"

#. Translators: Local reference audio file path.
msgid "Reference &audio file:"
msgstr "File &audio referensi:"

#. Translators: Choose the reference recording from disk.
msgid "&Browse reference…"
msgstr "&Telusuri referensi…"

#. Translators: Local consent audio file path.
msgid "&Consent audio file:"
msgstr "File audio &persetujuan:"

#. Translators: Choose the consent recording from disk.
msgid "Browse con&sent…"
msgstr "Telu&suri persetujuan…"

msgid ""
"I con&firm these are recordings of the same adult speaker who gave the "
"recorded consent."
msgstr ""
"Saya &konfirmasi bahwa ini adalah rekaman dari pembicara dewasa yang sama "
"yang memberikan persetujuan terekam."

#. Translators: Explicit paid upload and creation action.
msgid "Cr&eate voice"
msgstr "B&uat suara"

msgid "Choose WAV recording"
msgstr "Pilih rekaman WAV"

#. Translators: Missing local audio file; nothing has been uploaded.
msgid "Choose an existing WAV recording."
msgstr "Pilih rekaman WAV yang ada."

#. Translators: Required consent confirmation; Google also verifies the recording.
msgid "Confirm the speaker's recorded consent before creating the voice."
msgstr "Konfirmasi persetujuan terekam dari pembicara sebelum membuat suara."

msgid ""
"Native Speech Generation now uses a WebSocket connection. For the best "
"performance and compatibility, restart NVDA, open NVDA Settings, select "
"Native Speech Generation, and choose Reinstall Libraries."
msgstr ""
"Native Speech Generation sekarang menggunakan koneksi WebSocket. Untuk "
"kinerja dan kompatibilitas terbaik, mulai ulang NVDA, buka Pengaturan NVDA, "
"pilih Native Speech Generation, lalu pilih Instal Ulang Library."

#. Translators: Title of the warning shown after updating the add-on.
msgid "Native Speech Generation updated"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation telah diperbarui"

#. Translators: Long description for this add-on shown in NVDA's Add-ons Store and Add-ons Manager.
msgid ""
"Harness the power of Google's state-of-the-art Gemini AI for high-quality "
"speech generation directly within NVDA. This add-on provides a user-friendly "
"dialog to convert text into natural-sounding audio.\n"
"\n"
"Key Features:\n"
"- High-Quality Voices: Choose Gemini Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS for everyday "
"narration or Gemini Flash 3.8 TTS for expressive dialogue. Previous Gemini "
"3.1 and 2.5 TTS models remain available.\n"
"- Single and Multi-Speaker Modes: Easily generate audio for a single speaker "
"or create dynamic dialogues with two distinct speakers. Simply format your "
"text with \"SpeakerName:\" to assign voices.\n"
"- Advanced Voice Control: Fine-tune the output by adjusting the temperature "
"for more creative or stable results, and provide custom style instructions.\n"
"- Quick Speak: Speak selected text or clipboard text immediately with "
"separate model, voice, and style settings while keeping focus in the current "
"application.\n"
"- Seamless Workflow: The add-on provides instant audio playback upon "
"generation and allows you to save the resulting .wav file for later use.\n"
"\n"
"To get started, obtain a Gemini API key from Google AI Studio and enter it "
"in the add-on's settings panel, found under NVDA's Tools menu."
msgstr ""
"Manfaatkan teknologi AI Gemini Google untuk menghasilkan ucapan berkualitas "
"tinggi langsung di NVDA. Add-on ini menyediakan dialog yang mudah digunakan "
"untuk mengubah teks menjadi audio yang terdengar alami.\n"
"\n"
"Fitur Utama:\n"
"- Suara Berkualitas Tinggi: Pilih Gemini Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS untuk narasi "
"sehari-hari atau Gemini Flash 3.8 TTS untuk dialog yang ekspresif. Model TTS "
"Gemini 3.1 dan 2.5 sebelumnya tetap tersedia.\n"
"- Mode Satu dan Multi-Pembicara: Buat audio untuk satu pembicara atau dialog "
"dinamis dengan dua suara berbeda. Format teks dengan \"NamaPembicara:\" "
"untuk menetapkan suara.\n"
"- Kontrol Suara Lanjutan: Sesuaikan temperature untuk hasil yang lebih "
"kreatif atau stabil dan berikan instruksi gaya khusus.\n"
"- Quick Speak: Bacakan teks terpilih atau teks clipboard secara langsung "
"dengan pengaturan model, suara, dan gaya terpisah tanpa memindahkan fokus "
"dari aplikasi saat ini.\n"
"- Alur Kerja Mulus: Add-on memutar audio segera setelah dibuat dan "
"memungkinkan file .wav disimpan untuk digunakan nanti.\n"
"\n"
"Untuk memulai, dapatkan kunci API Gemini dari Google AI Studio dan masukkan "
"di panel pengaturan add-on pada menu Tools NVDA."

#. Translators: Short release notes shown for this add-on version.
msgid ""
"- Tested with NVDA 2026.3.\n"
"- Fixed Voice Library caching, voice creation, and dialog closing issues, "
"and updated the Indonesian translation.\n"
"- Added Voice Remix to create a new voice by describing changes to an "
"existing voice in Voice Library.\n"
"- Grouped Voice Design and Voice Replication under New voice with "
"descriptions.\n"
"- Added Voice Replication with reference and consent WAV uploads, consent "
"verification, and a paid-tier notice.\n"
"- Clarified that Voice Design requires an API key from a project with "
"billing enabled.\n"
"- Added Voice Design to create custom voices from descriptions in Voice "
"Library.\n"
"- Added Gender, Pitch, Persona, and Use case filters to Voice Library.\n"
"- Fixed existing samples for extended voice IDs such as en-us-fola and en-us-"
"rami.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation stage 2: Added a searchable Voice Library with "
"type and language filters, 70 verified voice samples and explicitly "
"generated previews with editable text, cached catalogs, and saved narrator/"
"speaker voices for Gemini 3.8 TTS.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation stage 1: Added Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite and Flash "
"TTS, structured style and speaker metadata, script validation, and Script "
"Help.\n"
"- Added Gemini 3.8 Live for Quick Speak and Talk with AI, and Gemini 3.8 "
"Live Extended Thinking for Talk with AI.\n"
"- Applied model-specific thinking settings while preserving existing model "
"preferences.\n"
"- Fixed interrupted WebSocket reads, permanent API error handling, reconnect "
"status, and keyboard focus preservation.\n"
"- See changelog.md for full details.\n"
msgstr ""
"- Diuji dengan NVDA 2026.3.\n"
"- Memperbaiki masalah cache Pustaka Suara, pembuatan suara, dan penutupan "
"dialog, serta memperbarui terjemahan bahasa Indonesia.\n"
"- Menambahkan Remiks Suara untuk membuat suara baru dengan menjelaskan "
"perubahan pada suara yang ada di Pustaka Suara.\n"
"- Mengelompokkan Desain Suara dan Replikasi Suara di bawah Suara baru, "
"lengkap dengan deskripsinya.\n"
"- Menambahkan Replikasi Suara dengan unggahan WAV referensi dan persetujuan, "
"verifikasi persetujuan, serta pemberitahuan tingkat berbayar.\n"
"- Memperjelas bahwa Desain Suara memerlukan kunci API dari proyek dengan "
"penagihan aktif.\n"
"- Menambahkan Desain Suara untuk membuat suara khusus dari deskripsi di "
"Pustaka Suara.\n"
"- Menambahkan filter Gender, Tinggi nada, Persona, dan Kegunaan ke Pustaka "
"Suara.\n"
"- Memperbaiki sampel yang ada untuk ID suara tambahan seperti en-us-fola dan "
"en-us-rami.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation tahap 2: Menambahkan Pustaka Suara yang dapat "
"dicari dengan filter jenis dan bahasa, 70 sampel suara terverifikasi dan "
"pratinjau yang dibuat secara eksplisit dengan teks yang dapat diubah, "
"katalog dalam cache, serta suara narator/pembicara tersimpan untuk Gemini "
"3.8 TTS.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation tahap 1: Menambahkan Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite dan "
"Flash TTS, metadata gaya dan pembicara terstruktur, validasi skrip, dan "
"Bantuan Skrip.\n"
"- Menambahkan Gemini 3.8 Live untuk Quick Speak dan Talk with AI, serta "
"Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking untuk Talk with AI.\n"
"- Menerapkan pengaturan thinking sesuai model sambil mempertahankan "
"preferensi model yang sudah tersimpan.\n"
"- Memperbaiki pembacaan WebSocket yang terputus, penanganan error API "
"permanen, status setelah koneksi ulang, dan pemeliharaan fokus keyboard.\n"
"- Lihat changelog.md untuk detail lengkap.\n"

